---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Bi from "../../components/Bi.astro";
import Shot from "../../components/Shot.astro";

const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, "")}/`;
---

<Base
  title="标签周期选择（生产模型） · Quant Research Portfolio"
  description="训练标签周期不必等于评估周期：将该思路应用于生产月频模型，各专家依代理标签选择自身周期"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">
        <span data-i18n="zh">专题 · 生产月频模型</span>
        <span data-i18n="en">Study · production monthly model</span>
      </p>
      <div class="hero-narrow">
        <Bi
          tag="h1"
          zh="标签周期选择（生产模型）"
          en="Label-horizon selection (production model)"
        />
        <Bi
          tag="p"
          class="lede"
          zh="训练标签周期不必等于评估周期；本文将这一思路应用于生产模型。"
          en="The training label horizon need not equal the evaluation horizon; this note applies that idea to the production model."
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="rows">
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="文献方法" en="Source paper" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="《The Label Horizon Paradox: Rethinking Supervision Targets in Financial Forecasting》（Song, Liu & Chen，arXiv:2602.03395v5）。论文指出最优训练标签周期往往不等于评估周期，并把这种现象归因于两个过程的竞争：信号随周期实现，噪声随周期累积（定理 3.2），据此给出性能的对数分解（式 5）——性能约等于「代理 IC × 对齐度 ρ(r_δ, r_20)」的乘积。落地上它提出一个双层（bi-level）优化框架，把标签周期当作可学参数，在一次训练内自动确定最优代理标签；验证覆盖中证 300 / 500 / 1000 与标普 500，周期为分钟级，十种网络结构。"
              en="“The Label Horizon Paradox: Rethinking Supervision Targets in Financial Forecasting” (Song, Liu & Chen, arXiv:2602.03395v5). The paper shows that the best training label horizon is often not the evaluation horizon and attributes it to two competing processes — signal realised with the horizon, noise accumulating with it (Theorem 3.2) — giving a log-performance decomposition (Eq. 5) in which performance is approximately the product of the proxy IC and an alignment term ρ(r_δ, r_20). Operationally it proposes a bi-level framework that treats the label horizon as a learnable parameter and identifies the best proxy label within a single training run; validation covers CSI 300 / 500 / 1000 and the S&P 500 at minute-level horizons across ten architectures."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="本文调整" en="Adaptation" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="论文的双层优化需要在训练内部反向传播周期参数，生产模型是月频、模型族也不同，因此不照搬：改为把式 5 的分解做成一离线评分（评分 = 代理 IC × 对齐度），在候选网格 1/2/3/5/8/13/20 上为每个专家选期，另加一条独立性去重规则；对齐度只用收益计算，与模型无关。"
              en="The paper's bi-level objective back-propagates through the horizon parameter inside training; the production model is monthly and a different model family, so that is not ported. Instead Eq. 5 becomes an offline score (score = proxy IC × alignment) evaluated per expert over the grid 1/2/3/5/8/13/20, with a distinctness rule added on top; the alignment term is computed from returns only and is model-free."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="主要结论" en="Result" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="本地的分解项与论文一致：对齐度 ρ(r_δ, r_20) 随周期单调上升（1 日 0.19 → 20 日 1.000，20 日即评估周期），而代理 IC 在中途见顶后回落（GRU 12 日 0.117、XGBoost 9 日 0.068、Linear 端部 0.052）——两者相乘使评分偏向长端。实际运行的 144 次选期因此全部落在 20 日，独立性去重规则没有触发。相对 Linear 锚，模型 RankIC 均值提高 0.29pp（4.05%、IR 0.234），幅度有限。"
              en="Locally the decomposition behaves as the paper describes: alignment ρ(r_δ, r_20) rises monotonically with the horizon (0.19 at one day to 1.000 at twenty, the evaluation horizon), while the proxy IC peaks in the middle and falls back (GRU 0.117 at twelve days, XGBoost 0.068 at nine, Linear 0.052 at the long end) — their product tilts the score towards the long end. All 144 recorded selections therefore land on 20 days and the distinctness rule never triggers. Against the Linear anchor the model's mean RankIC rises by 0.29pp (4.05%, IR 0.234), a limited gain."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="实验口径" en="Setup" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="在生产月频 linear + XGBoost + GRU 模型上实现：按专家分别选周期，不改变评估与回测口径，也不改变调仓频率；结论与运行使用同一股票池、同一频率。"
              en="Implemented on the production monthly linear + XGBoost + GRU model: horizons are chosen per expert without changing the evaluation, the backtest convention or the rebalance frequency, and the conclusion holds for the same universe and frequency it was run on."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="tag"><Bi tag="span" zh="局限与边界" en="Limits" /></span>
          <div class="body">
            <Bi
              tag="p"
              zh="论文的双层优化、分钟级周期与十种网络结构都没有复现，因此这里只能算「把分解式当离线评分使用」，不构成对论文方法的验证；更换股票池、频率或标签定义均需重跑；周期选择基于同一段历史，存在选择偏差。另外，落盘的分候选评分无法还原「恒选 20 日」这一决策——网格内均值最高点是 Linear 与 XGBoost 的 20 日、GRU 的 13 日——选期环节的取舍需要补充记录才能复核。"
              en="The paper's bi-level optimisation, minute-level horizons and ten architectures are not reproduced, so this is “using the decomposition as an offline score” rather than a validation of the paper's method; a different universe, frequency or label definition requires its own run; the horizons were selected on the same history they are judged on, so selection bias remains. The stored per-candidate scores also do not reproduce the “always 20” decision — within the grid the highest mean is 20 days for Linear and XGBoost but 13 days for GRU — so the selection step needs fuller logging before it can be audited."
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure>
        <Shot
          name="label_horizon"
          altZh="三个专家选中的标签周期（全部落在 20 日）与候选周期的平均评分"
          altEn="The label horizon chosen by each expert (all land on 20 days) and the mean score by candidate horizon"
        />
        <figcaption>
          <Bi
            tag="span"
            zh="选期结果，2018-03 – 2026-07 共 48 次选期、每位专家一次。a 选中次数：横轴为可选网格（1/2/3/5/8/13/20），纵轴为被选中的次数（三位专家各 48 次，共 144 次选期）——20 日被选中 144 次，其余 6 个候选一次未被选中。b 论文式 5 的两个分解项（只计入被接受的候选，横轴为实际被打分的 14 个周期）：深黑为对齐度 ρ(r_δ, r_20)，与模型无关，随周期单调升至 1.000；三条灰线为各专家的代理 IC，均在 9–13 日见顶后回落。两者相乘即选期评分——长端因此占优，但这仍无法解释 GRU 为何也选 20 日（其网格内均值最高点是 13 日）。"
            en="Selections from 2018-03 to 2026-07, 48 rounds with one choice per expert. a — times selected: the x-axis is the selectable grid (1/2/3/5/8/13/20) and the y-axis the number of times each candidate was chosen, across 144 selections (48 per expert): 20 days was chosen 144 times and the other six candidates never. b — the two terms of the paper's Eq. 5 (accepted candidates only, across the 14 horizons actually scored): ink is the model-free alignment ρ(r_δ, r_20), rising monotonically to 1.000, while the three grey lines are each expert's proxy IC, all peaking between nine and thirteen days. Their product is the selection score, which favours the long end — yet that still does not explain why GRU also lands on 20 days, since its in-grid mean peaks at 13."
          />
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="pager">
        <a href={`${base}notes/top50-objective/`}>
          <span data-i18n="zh">← 头部 50 只目标函数</span>
          <span data-i18n="en">← Top-50 objective</span>
        </a>
        <a href={base}>
          <span data-i18n="zh">返回首页 →</span>
          <span data-i18n="en">Home →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
